# Local databases / runtime data (these live in the OS app-data dir, not the repo;
# ignored only in case a dev points the app at the working tree). Note: Cargo.lock
# is intentionally NOT ignored — it is committed for this application.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db.bak-*
project.lock

